From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jrash <johnrash@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 08:55:29 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 086/342] ffmpeg plugin: Advanced SIMD 4:2:0 to B_YCbCr422 on
 arm64

Video for overlays that can't show B_RGB32 (the Amlogic VPU's video
layer) is decoded to B_YCbCr422. For planar 4:2:0 that went through
swscale's yv12toyuy2(), which is C on arm64: 5.6 ms a 1920x1080 frame on
the ODROID-C2. gfx_conv_yuv420p_ycbcr422_neon() does the same 32 pixels
at a time: the same bytes (identical hashes for 90 frames of H.264, HEVC,
VP9 and AV1), 2.3-3 ms less per 1080p frame, and MediaPlayer's frame
generator thread went from 28% to 18-23% of a core.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../media/plugins/ffmpeg/AVCodecDecoder.cpp   | 21 ++++++++
 src/add-ons/media/plugins/ffmpeg/Jamfile      |  4 ++
 .../media/plugins/ffmpeg/gfx_conv_neon.c      | 51 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../media/plugins/ffmpeg/gfx_conv_neon.h      | 24 +++++++++
 4 files changed, 100 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/add-ons/media/plugins/ffmpeg/gfx_conv_neon.c
 create mode 100644 src/add-ons/media/plugins/ffmpeg/gfx_conv_neon.h

diff --git a/src/add-ons/media/plugins/ffmpeg/AVCodecDecoder.cpp b/src/add-ons/media/plugins/ffmpeg/AVCodecDecoder.cpp
index af9dd2da68..b1c57d899f 100644
--- a/src/add-ons/media/plugins/ffmpeg/AVCodecDecoder.cpp
+++ b/src/add-ons/media/plugins/ffmpeg/AVCodecDecoder.cpp
@@ -26,6 +26,9 @@
 #include <String.h>
 
 #include "Utilities.h"
+#if defined(__aarch64__)
+#	include "gfx_conv_neon.h"
+#endif
 
 
 static const int kMinimumVideoThreads = 8;
@@ -1709,6 +1712,24 @@ AVCodecDecoder::_DeinterlaceAndColorConvertVideoFrame()
 	fPostProcessedDecodedPicture->linesize[0]
 		= fHeader.u.raw_video.bytes_per_row;
 
+#if defined(__aarch64__)
+	if (fOutputColorSpace == B_YCbCr422
+		&& fCodecContext->pix_fmt == AV_PIX_FMT_YUV420P) {
+		// swscale does this in C on arm64
+		if (useDeinterlacedPicture) {
+			AVFrame deinterlacedFrame;
+			for (int i = 0; i < 4; i++) {
+				deinterlacedFrame.data[i] = deinterlacedPicture.data[i];
+				deinterlacedFrame.linesize[i] = deinterlacedPicture.linesize[i];
+			}
+			gfx_conv_yuv420p_ycbcr422_neon(&deinterlacedFrame,
+				fPostProcessedDecodedPicture, displayWidth, displayHeight);
+		} else {
+			gfx_conv_yuv420p_ycbcr422_neon(fRawDecodedPicture,
+				fPostProcessedDecodedPicture, displayWidth, displayHeight);
+		}
+	} else
+#endif
 #if USE_SWS_FOR_COLOR_SPACE_CONVERSION
 	if (fSwsContext != NULL) {
 #else
